test('group requester can ask for manual people without broadening financial scope or linking homonyms',async()=>{const q=await create('groupclerk',{origin:'OTHERS',rows:[{financialIntent:'ADVANCE',subject:{kind:'EMPLOYEE',name:'TEST employee2'},question:'TEST manual match'}]});assert.equal(row(q).subject.userId,undefined);assert.equal(q.approverId,'lead');assert.equal(store().users.find((u:any)=>u.id==='groupclerk').accessScope,undefined);assert.equal((await action(q,'lead','APPROVE')).status,200);assert.equal((await respond(q)).status,200);assert.equal((await view(q,'groupclerk')).rows[0].replies.length,1);assert.equal((await view(q,'employee2')),undefined);});
